{"version":1,"key":"card:531","content":{"id":531,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背景：在 Electron 应用中需要实现全文搜索功能，技术方案是通过 sqlite 的 FTS5 进行全文检索，但是 FTS5 对中文检索不太行，需要先进行分词，经过调研决定使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nodejieba","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行分词。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题："},{"type":"formatted","text":"nodejieba","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 需要使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"node-gyp","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rebuild","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才能构建应用，但是在 Windows 上怎么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rebuild","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都不成功，也搜索不到原因为啥"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17c8dfc8-5bc0-4b2f-84a9-94d6e8ceade4.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17c8dfc8-5bc0-4b2f-84a9-94d6e8ceade4.png","width":698,"borderRadius":"none"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后来搜索发现了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"@node-rs/jieba","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不需要进行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rebuild","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，直击我的心窝，而且速度还快"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_627407c6-9ad6-44a1-a1a4-a71042ebe5dd.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_627407c6-9ad6-44a1-a1a4-a71042ebe5dd.png","width":674.5},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字典时，由于它是动态 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"readFile","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 读取，而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"import { dict } from \"@node-rs/jieba/dict\";","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a3f107fc-e0b0-4d41-a421-2097aed4398b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// dict.js\nconst fs = require('fs')\nconst { join } = require('path')\n\nmodule.exports.dict = fs.readFileSync(join(__dirname, 'dict.txt'))\nmodule.exports.idf = fs.readFileSync(join(__dirname, 'idf.txt'))","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8597596d-98b9-4b6a-9221-617f4ca1116a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而我的文件是需要进行打包的，这种情况无法打包到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dict.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"idf.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，读取时就会报错"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_12988927-cba7-4c6e-b902-b298e4da4c3a.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_12988927-cba7-4c6e-b902-b298e4da4c3a.png","width":698},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解决这个问题，需要做几件事："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把读取的文件复制到构建目录下，需要为 Vite 写一个 Rollup 插件"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"plugins: [\n  {\n    name: \"jieba-dict-copy\",\n    closeBundle() {\n      // 构建完成后触发\n      fs.copySync(\n        \"node_modules/@node-rs/jieba/dict.txt\",\n        \"dist-electron/main/dict.txt\",\n      );\n      fs.copySync(\n        \"node_modules/@node-rs/jieba/idf.txt\",\n        \"dist-electron/main/idf.txt\",\n      );\n    },\n  },\n],","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"75cd203d-3c9d-47fa-92df-4bddfee66634","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拦截 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dict.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"idf.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，修改 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 路径为资源路径"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const originalResolve = require.resolve;\nrequire.resolve = function (spec: string, options: any) {\n  if (spec.endsWith(\"dict.txt\") || spec.endsWith(\"idf.txt\")) {\n    const realPath = path.join(\n      app.isPackaged ? process.resourcesPath : __dirname,\n      spec,\n    );\n    return realPath;\n  }\n  return originalResolve(spec, options);\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b53f7ed9-707c-4fec-973c-ed24eb269846","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"修改 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"electron-builder.yaml","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dict.txt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 idf.txt 文件打包到资源目录下，保证生产环境也能读取到文件"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"extraResources:\n  - from: dist-electron/main/dict.txt\n    to: dict.txt\n    filter: [\"**/*\"]\n  - from: dist-electron/main/idf.txt\n    to: idf.txt\n    filter: [\"**/*\"]","language":"YAML","uuid":"ec2fd394-9aa3-4eab-931c-ce87c0de2fa2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当初为了保险做了第二步和第三步，不过第二步和第三步是必须的吗？"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["Electron/踩坑","踩坑/Electron","全文搜索","分词"],"createTime":1742094950990,"updateTime":1776833803812,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1776833803812}}